## Sample Execution

### Input

| Parameter     | Value          |
| ------------- | -------------- |
| Phone Number  | +91 7032694836 |
| Generated OTP | 1234567        |
| User OTP      | 1234567        |

### Output

```text
OTP verification successful.
```

