---

## Limitations

Current version:

* Simulates SMS delivery only.
* OTP does not expire.
* No resend OTP functionality.
* No maximum attempt limit.

---

## Future Enhancements

* Integrate Twilio API for real SMS delivery.
* OTP expiration timer.
* Resend OTP feature.
* Maximum verification attempts.
* Email-based OTP verification.
* Streamlit Web Application.
* Two-Factor Authentication (2FA) support.

