---

## Conclusion

The OTP Verification System successfully demonstrates the implementation of a simple authentication mechanism using Python. Although the current version simulates SMS delivery, the project provides a strong foundation for developing real-world verification systems using APIs such as Twilio, Fast2SMS, or MSG91.

